<title>TOGO: Togolese leader leaves for Norway visit.</title>
<headline>Togolese leader leaves for Norway visit.</headline>
<dateline>LOME 1996-10-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Togolese President Gnassingbe Eyadema left Lome on Sunday for a four-day official visit to Norway, government officials said.</p>
<p>They did not disclose the details of his programme or the reasons for the visit.</p>
</text>
